      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
